      "message": "study: tau-bench runtime-intervention + detection write-up\n\nFront-page README: N=50 airline A/B (intervention 28/50 vs 24/50, the -8pp is\nsingle-trial noise — intervention acted on 4 tasks, changed 0) + detector as\ntask-level failure predictor (precision 0.41, recall 0.50, near chance).\nReceipts: ab_runA/B_full.json (50 tasks each), ab_summary.json, ab_measure.py.\nScrubbed an internal path from a task-29 traceback in runA.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
